<!-- Inline Link -->
<div class="pg-section" id="section-1">
  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Inline Link</h3>
  <p class="pg-section-desc">A bare <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> is coloured but not underlined, so it suits navigation and components. Inside running text, add <code>.sui-link</code> so links are not marked by colour alone (WCAG 1.4.1). Colours come from <code>--sui-primary-text</code>, which meets 4.5:1 in light and dark themes; set <code>--sui-link</code>, <code>--sui-link-hover</code> and <code>--sui-link-underline</code> to recolour links (see <a class="sui-link" href="/theming/#colors">Theming</a>).</p>
