<!-- Subtle & Muted -->
<div class="pg-section" id="section-2">
  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Subtle & Muted</h3>
  <p class="pg-section-desc"><code>.sui-link-subtle</code> keeps the surrounding text colour and turns primary on hover. <code>.sui-link-muted</code> uses the muted text colour, for footnotes and secondary text. Both keep the underline. Each class is standalone; you do not need <code>.sui-link</code> as well.</p>
