<!-- Arrow Link -->
<div class="pg-section" id="section-3">
  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Arrow Link</h3>
  <p class="pg-section-desc"><code>.sui-link-arrow</code> is a standalone call to action with a trailing arrow that nudges forward on hover. The underline appears on hover and never runs under the arrow. In RTL the arrow points left; with reduced motion the nudge is instant.</p>
